{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act15side_level_act15side_07_end",
  "groupId": "act15side",
  "stageId": "act15side_07",
  "title": "乱局",
  "storyCode": "IW-7",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act15side/level_act15side_07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b57fba0de4a9673289fc2613599f8a843add5881def14f5fa64e780490b1acf0",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "07下"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "......到哪儿去了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "器伥",
      "text": "嗷嗷！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "唔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "在那边的树杈上......而且还聚起了这么一大批古灵精怪......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "器伥",
      "text": "嗷......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "......哈哈，这下我要怎么取来呢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一枚黑子。\n万物皆有所待，这些器伥的脾性，是和这些器物的“意”相通的。\n那么，扰我清静的......\n是我那摆弄画卷泼墨江山的妹妹呢，还是那一字千金口含天宪的妹妹呢？\n又或者......\n只是他一子拍下，砸起的片刻杂音呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤？",
      "text": "......让开。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "器伥",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "器伥",
      "text": "呜——呜呜！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤？",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "......好久不见。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "......嗯？您应该是......罗德岛的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "啊啊。原来是老鲤啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "好久不见，怎么从龙门来尚蜀了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年",
      "text": "哎，你说掌柜的抽刀而走，是不是找谁干架去了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "text": "谁知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年",
      "text": "我们这些新来的，已经不见掌柜的用刀啦。想来也是，家大业大的，光靠酒楼就能在尚蜀站稳脚跟了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年",
      "text": "掌柜的到底怎么用刀？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "text": "掌柜的这些年，用刀的次数实在不多。真要说，那就是砍瓜切菜，剁肉杀鳞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "text": "比起过去打打杀杀的日子，郑掌柜已经很久不以“伤人”为目的用刀了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年",
      "text": "......有一种江湖高人隐退的感觉？那现在他带刀出去做啥？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "text": "切菜吧。切了这么久的菜了，掌柜的也就会切切菜了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街头青年",
      "text": "无聊哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客栈伙计",
      "text": "那咋的，切那么多年菜，还能变厉害不成？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "好刀法！看来你这几年不光是在当一个掌柜的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "......不，我确实没有再用过刀了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "习惯了持筹握算，柴米油盐......我也没想到，这把霜刀如今还能如此顺手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "意料之外。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......我还在想，要是遇到的是一个郁郁寡欢的郑清钺，打赢了又怎样，输了又怎样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "看来是天意如此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "——什么天意，不过是你一厢情愿想要报仇罢了吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "唔......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "夜儿！你别插手！快去追那个龙门人，找到酒盏！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "抱歉了爹，这件事你可做不了主——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "呃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "我就猜到会这样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "......我从来没打过她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "郑掌柜",
      "text": "你会后悔的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "......太合叔。你去帮掌柜的一把。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "公子您？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "我去找盏，此事耽搁不起。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "慢着！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "休想！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "呃，你这大块头能不能悠着点，再拆下去我们怎么下山？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "困兽之斗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "恩人！这里我拖着，你先去帮鲤兄！别让那小子得手！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "好！你自己注意！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "我告诉你可别欺负人啊，就因为你是当官的我才不敢动手的——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "......官身？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "我既为报知遇之恩，与左公子同行，还谈什么官身。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "来！廉家传人，你我单纯以武人身份，互相试试斤两。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌有",
      "text": "......那就得罪了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "......唔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "下雨了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民",
      "text": "......下起雨来了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民",
      "text": "明明天气预报说今天都是晴天来着。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶馆伙计",
      "text": "客人，下雨了，您要不挪步去里头坐坐？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......不了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶馆伙计",
      "text": "客人是想赏雨景？好兴致好兴致，那我一会儿给您把伞撑起来......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶馆伙计",
      "text": "陪您一起的那位船夫呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "他上山去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶馆伙计",
      "text": "这会上山？天黑了怕是下不来山哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "是啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "是我麻烦他了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "......！是那个龙门人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "器伥围在他身边......？等等，他旁边那个人是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "哦。好像有新客人了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "......年！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "你也是来抢这只酒盏的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "......呼。比起预想，已经算人少一些的了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "大炎司岁台秉烛人左乐，奉太傅手谕，密查夕与黑酒盏下落。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "器伥",
      "text": "嗷......嗷......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "......这些小东西，似乎挺怕你俩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "怕我嘛，正常，怕这个小子嘛......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "你身上带着什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "你倒是机敏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "嗯哼......是这样......就和那个糟老头子说的一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "那么鲤先生又是怎么和这件事扯上关系的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "年小姐，这其中恐怕说来话长......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "不过把罗德岛几位干员卷入其中，我深感愧疚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "无妨。克洛丝和小炎熔要是经历不起这点风浪，她们也很难见证到最后了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "......哎呀，年小姐真是没变呢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "毕竟这两天，我们可被折腾惨了。不过那个可怕的老头儿还是告诉了我们一些事情的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "包括司岁台和礼部之间的小摩擦。这位小哥，你们就这么急着......想除掉我们吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "除了我擅自把夕带离她的舒适小窝，一定有别的什么原因吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "说来听听？要是说得有理，指不定我能改变心思，帮你们一把哦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "与你无关。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "不过既然你主动现身，那更好......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "她在哪儿？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "......你说谁？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "别装傻！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "那你们爬错山了啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "她在山顶，在这片云海山峦中最高峰的山顶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "你们爬到那座山峰上了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "......忘水坪什么都没有，与寻常山道无异。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "是吗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "——！别动那只杯子——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "哦......这不是年吗？\n好久不见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "什、什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "此时此刻此地，才是尚蜀山峦之中的最高处。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "一般谈论“最高处”的时候，是不用带上此时此刻的吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "良辰美景方为山顶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "只是物理意义上的最高有什么意义，我在这儿垫一个椅子，不就更高一截了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "......这个地方......我确实......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "在梦里见过？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "年小姐果然知道些什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "当然了。你和这玩意在一起的时间太久了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "虽然寻常人类发现不了这只酒盏的秘密，但是司岁台也好你也好都太不注意了点哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "......还是说，这也是你的考量......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "年？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "不。我的事情先不提......那边那位少年似乎想要积极发言？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "......首先，我要求你们为夕的离开做出解释。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "克洛丝小姐仍旧把你当作罗德岛的一员，如此说来，在场三人，全部都与那罗德岛有关。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "根据你们的回答和今次事件的结果......我会考虑上书朝廷，严肃对待此事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "唔......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "把夕带走只是我的判断，罗德岛也不过是接受了我的私人委托而已，这样的答案满意吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "不满意。你们十二人任何一次会晤、通信、交谈都是牵扯司岁台神经的大事，你怎会不知道？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "哦，年纪轻轻，口气倒是挺老成......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "司岁台现在的老大是谁？我认得不？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "......你游手好闲太久，人间已变了几个模样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "可惜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "夕在哪里？令又在哪里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "你们三人相聚尚蜀，又打算做什么？这只酒盏......又隐藏了什么秘密？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "酒盏明明是你们托人从龙门送来的，怎么还怪起我们来了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "你知道司岁台必须把它握在手里的意义——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "——当然，这其中可是拘押着我那好二哥的部分意识的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "......你很清楚。那就很难说几位都是不知者无罪了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "我可没打算装什么不知者......虽然梁洵确实什么都没告诉我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "......哈哈，事到如今我说罗德岛什么都不知道会不会有点牵强？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "那是，毕竟你是受害者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "我吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "我也是刚刚才意识到的。反倒是你们司岁台啊，一群闲着没事的琢磨了这么多年，还琢磨不出吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "巨兽不仅能将自己分离成拥有独立人格的代理人，也能将自己的意识存储在一些媒介中苟且偷生......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "......但是你们代理人原来还能再做一次同样的事情吗？就像乌萨斯套娃一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "我也不知道我们能不能啊......说不定是他新琢磨出来的吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "为了凑齐一百八十一颗黑子之类的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "......他不会疯掉吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "他不是已经疯掉了吗。就关押在京城，你们又不是见不到他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "与他见面，是莫大的禁忌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "司岁台都做了这么多事，还在乎这？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "夕呢？你找夕做什么？找了夕还来这里，又为了什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "......我有一个想法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "text": "根据记载，你总是有很多想法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "嗯......你倒是挺了解我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "（看向这边了......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "我想......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "......想办法干掉那个玩意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "雨。\n细密的春雨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一个走水路的船夫，此刻走在高高的山上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "......天快黑了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "唉......上山下山的，可苦了我这把老骨头......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
